      <activity id="f8a46b2b-e640-5f39-ba23-3e2dac6c6e5b" activityNameId="b2778932-16ab-53f6-bd1c-3ca9b7eafa94" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cogen unit 200kWe diesel SCR, common components for heat+electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cogen unit 200kWe diesel SCR, common components for heat+electricity
The module summarises infrastructure components of a cogeneration unit. ;
Synonyms: Selective Catalytic Reduction, SCR; 
UUID: 5e24cd07-20bf-31d2-b8f4-40bdf14cc4f9
The module includes all shared components for heat and electricity production. Includes also SCR and oxidation catalytic converter.
Location: Extrapolated from data of a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER).
Technology: Partly extrapolated from data of a 160kWe lambda=1 natural gas plant, adjusted to diesel cogen with SCR and oxidation catalytic converters.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text, see Technolgy Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e24cd07-20bf-31d2-b8f4-40bdf14cc4f9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
